# CVE-2026-32871: SSRF in fastmcp's MCP server component. fastmcp arrives as
# a transitive dependency of mlflow (which pins the vulnerable range, so no
# compatible fixed version exists). Our containers use the mlflow client and
# never start an MCP server; the vulnerable code path is unreachable.
# Accepted 2026-08-01. Revisit when mlflow client is next upgraded.
CVE-2026-32871
